nk  we're going to move on to that deeper  maybe darker plot that's been hinted at  i had a second prediction and i was very  wrong and i didn't think about it that  much so i'm retracting it and no i'm not  gonna share it with you  three there's gonna be something to do  with eve or adam and eve and there's  gonna be something in the past that  happened that was really important to  evolution or that our development as a  species maybe we arrived on an asteroid  to this planet you know that's that's an  old thing because there's asteroids  um  and the second impact was kind of a big  thing i actually know how the aliens  ended up on the planet to be honest but  uh maybe that's gonna be revealed uh and  also i think that as this conspiracy  kind of gets developed someone we think  we can trust is going to be revealed to  be bad maybe miss masato's boyfriend i  don't know just my guess please do not  spoil things for me in the comments i am  really enjoying it so far do you want to  see  like my review of later episodes  no i i don't know  uh stay nerdy and i will see you in the  future
 

